<title>USA: Perfumania increases stock repurchase plan.</title>
<headline>Perfumania increases stock repurchase plan.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Perfumania Inc said on Thursday its board of directors increased the number of authorized shares under the company's stock repurchase program.</p>
<p>The company said it may acquire from time to time up to two million additional shares of common stock, in addition to the 500,000 shares previously authorized.</p>
</text>
